OL,3,GNEWSAPub loses 'thousands' in Thames
OL,4,AWater outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are calling for answers from
OL,7,FThames Water after the water supply in
OL,8,Fa historic market town was cut off five
OL,9,Ftimes in two years, with businesses
OL,10,Flosing "thousands".
OL,12,FRoyal Wootton Bassett in Wiltshire saw
OL,13,Fits most recent outage last weekend and
OL,14,Flocal restaurant owner Ashley Windle
OL,15,Fsaid he had to "cancel" and
OL,16,F"disappoint" 260 customers last Sunday
OL,17,Flosing "thousands" of pounds in both
OL,18,Frevenue and fresh food wastage.
OL,20,FChippenham MP Sarah Gibson has asked
OL,21,FThames Water to attend a public meeting
OL,22,Fthis month to talk about solutions.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
